          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagira bamusambishe baca basubira inyuma ubwo nyene. Na wa mukuru w’abasoda agira ubwoba kuko yabohesheje Pawulo, kandi ari Umuroma.",
          "type": "text",
